---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Con Gusto Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for the Con Gusto marketing site and preview coordination."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy notes for the Con Gusto public website"
    description="Last updated: April 2026"
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container support-card section-panel prose-block">
      <p>
        This page describes how the public Con Gusto marketing site handles information today.
        The public site at congustoapp.com is a marketing and contact surface. The broader
        backend and product rollout are still in progress, so this page does not claim that
        live in-product workflows are publicly available yet.
      </p>

      <strong>What this site collects</strong>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li><span>Information you choose to send us by email, such as demo requests or support questions.</span></li>
        <li><span>Basic web server and hosting logs that are typically required to operate and secure a website.</span></li>
        <li><span>Information needed to respond to privacy requests you send to us directly.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <strong>What this site does not do</strong>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li><span>No account signup flow is publicly active on this marketing site.</span></li>
        <li><span>No customer-facing backend workflow is represented here as broadly live.</span></li>
        <li><span>No external marketing fonts or third-party embed widgets are loaded by default on this site.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <strong>How information is used</strong>
      <p>
        We use contact information you send us to respond to walkthrough requests,
        support questions, preview coordination, and privacy inquiries. We use routine
        hosting and security logs to keep the site available and protected.
      </p>

      <strong>Preview and future product data</strong>
      <p>
        If Con Gusto opens broader preview or production product access in the future,
        additional product-specific privacy terms may be published to reflect those workflows.
      </p>

      <strong>Contact</strong>
      <p>
        <a class="inline-link" href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a><br />
        <a class="inline-link" href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a><br />
        <a class="inline-link" href={site.siteUrl}>{site.siteUrl}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
